  "question": {
    "text": "A block of mass <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is stationary with respect to the wedge of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> moving with uniform speed <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math> on horizontal surface. Work done by friction force on the block in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> seconds is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0011_a4e76defa18e.png\" style=\"width: 229px; height: 198px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
